error_signature: "ERROR: Remote 'ohpcd' doesn't exist"
root_cause: "新隔离 job 的 conan-home 是全新缓存：remotes.json 只有 conancenter、profiles 为空；run-conan-heavy.sh 直跑 build_and_test.sh 不经过 setup.sh，L0i 探测依赖时 remote 不存在（被误报为 registry unreachable）；且 setup.sh 的 conan profile import 静默不生效。"
rec_approach: "新 job 首跑前：. env.sh && zsh ci/conan/setup.sh（注册 ohpcd + 禁 conancenter，幂等）；手动 cp ci/conan/profiles/ohos-aarch64 到 $CONAN_HOME/profiles/（import 不可靠）；conan profile list / remote list 双验证；再逐依赖 conan download -r=ohpcd --only-recipe 预演 L0i。"
match_keywords: ["Remote 'ohpcd' doesn't exist", "registry unreachable", "conan-home", "profile import", "ohos-prepare-isolated-conan-job", "L0i", "R36", "隔离 job"]
error_excerpt: "[error] registry unreachable for: xz/5.8.3.2 (conan stderr: ERROR: Remote 'ohpcd' doesn't exist)"
severity: P1
category: platform
last_updated: 2026-09-27
